flowchart LR
  accTitle: Checklist item states
  accDescr: A checklist item moves from to do through in progress to done, while an impediment can move it to blocked until resolved.

  checklist["Checklist item"]
  unchecked["[ ] To do"]
  progress["[/] In progress"]
  done["[x] Done"]
  blocked["[-] Blocked"]

  checklist --> unchecked
  unchecked --> progress
  progress --> done
  progress -. impediment .-> blocked
  blocked -. resolved .-> progress
